  "details": "It looks VRCApi.CreateNewAvatar and VRCApi.UpdateAvatarBundle internal PublicAPI returns VRCAvatar which holds avatar information after upload.\n\nHowever, UpdateAvatarBundle doesn't return the VRCAvatar so I have to re-fetch from API to get updated VRCAvatar. It's not efficient so could BuildAndUpload return VRCAvatar instead of void?\n\nChanging return type is (binary) breaking changes so It's impossible after API stabilization. So, I want this before VRCSDK 3.3.0 stabilization.",
